sequenceDiagram
  participant M as Mobile App
  participant B as Backend FastAPI
  participant S as Supabase

  M->>B: POST /api/v1/predictions (gambar + data + worker_id)
  B->>S: Validasi worker_id di tabel workers
  S-->>B: Worker valid dan aktif
  B->>S: Upload gambar ke Storage bucket feses-images
  S-->>B: URL gambar tersimpan
  B->>S: INSERT ke tabel predictions
  S-->>B: Data berhasil disimpan
  B-->>M: 201 Created - data prediksi tersimpan
  M->>M: Tampilkan notifikasi sukses
